<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32254" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκρεμ-άννῡμι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κρεμάσω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hang from</i> or <i>upon</i>
			a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				22
			</span></i> (dub.) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἔκ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					1363
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθον τοῦ ποδός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.100
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ἐξ Ὀλύμπου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					1.3.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκρέμαμαι</span>
			, <i>hang on by, cling to,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν τε ξυσκήνων ἤδη ἀπιόντων
					ἐκκρεμαννύμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.75
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>to be devoted to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρεος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					950
				</span></i>
			.</div>
